      "expected_counterexamples": ["digital", "legacy"],
      "unresolved_business_decisions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "java-billing",
      "language": "Java",
      "question": "Is finalizing an invoice without approval always forbidden? Explain the temporal and configuration scope, and whether historical import records establish the current application's rule. No live business database is provided.",
